[11.410638, "o", "charmcraft.yaml ACT001 Missing 'get-health' action (or alias: health-check, check-health, get-status, health)\r\ncharmcraft.yaml ACT002 Missing 'pause' action (or alias: stop, disable)\r\ncharmcraft.yaml ACT003 Missing 'resume' action (or alias: start, enable)\r\ncharmcraft.yaml CFG004 Config option 'log-level' is declared but never read in src/ — operators can set it but the charm ignores it\r\nCFG005 Charm declares config options but never references BlockedStatus — invalid config has no visible status\r\nDOC001 No README.md found\r\nDOC002 No installation/setup documentation found\r\nDOC003 No configuration documentation found\r\nDOC004 No usage documentation found\r\nDOC005 No troubleshooting documentation found\r\ncharmcraft.yaml META002 Missing 'display-name' field\r\ncharmcraft.yaml META004 Missing 'description' field\r\ncharmcraft.yaml META005 Missing 'docs' URL\r\ncharmcraft.yaml META006 Missing 'issues' URL\r\ncharmcraft.yaml META007 Missing 'source' URL\r\ncharmcraft.yaml COS001 Missing tracing relation (interface: tracing)\r\ncharmcraft.yaml COS002 Missing metrics-endpoint relation (interface: prometheus_scrape)\r\ncharmcraft.yaml COS003 Missing logging relation (interface: loki_push_api)\r\ncharmcraft.yaml COS004 Missing grafana-dashboard relation (interface: grafana_dashboard)\r\nCOS005 ops-tracing not detected — add for distributed tracing\r\nSEC002 No TLS/encryption support detected\r\nSTS001 No BlockedStatus for missing required configuration\r\n"]
